    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a brave young man in <i>Silent Whisper</i>, a spine-chilling first-person horror experience that will test your courage, wits, and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawn to an abandoned school with a tragic and haunting history, your curiosity quickly turns into a nightmare. Once inside, everything goes wrong, trapping you in a crumbling building filled with dark secrets. As you explore its decaying halls and eerie classrooms, you'll uncover the grim truth behind the school's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485950/extras/6dca1e05502c4d183baa31c1c58d8093.avif?t=1743104765\" data-has-big width=800 height=467 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong>: Experience the dread of exploring an abandoned school brought to life with eerie visuals, haunting sound design, and dynamic lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Search the rundown building for clues and escape routes, unraveling its sinister mysteries along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension-Fueled Survival</strong>: Evade terrifying entities that lurk in the darkness, using stealth and clever tactics to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Past</strong>: Piece together the heartbreaking story of what happened to the students and staff through journals, notes, and artifacts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer your fears and escape, or will the <i>Silent Whisper</i> claim another victim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485950/extras/838b750592dcb78c9fd7a736f683f5cc.avif?t=1743104765\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a brave young man in <i>Silent Whisper</i>, a spine-chilling first-person horror experience that will test your courage, wits, and survival instincts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drawn to an abandoned school with a tragic and haunting history, your curiosity quickly turns into a nightmare. Once inside, everything goes wrong, trapping you in a crumbling building filled with dark secrets. As you explore its decaying halls and eerie classrooms, you'll uncover the grim truth behind the school's past.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485950/extras/6dca1e05502c4d183baa31c1c58d8093.avif?t=1743104765\" data-has-big width=800 height=467 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Atmosphere</strong>: Experience the dread of exploring an abandoned school brought to life with eerie visuals, haunting sound design, and dynamic lighting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration</strong>: Search the rundown building for clues and escape routes, unraveling its sinister mysteries along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tension-Fueled Survival</strong>: Evade terrifying entities that lurk in the darkness, using stealth and clever tactics to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Past</strong>: Piece together the heartbreaking story of what happened to the students and staff through journals, notes, and artifacts.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you conquer your fears and escape, or will the <i>Silent Whisper</i> claim another victim?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3485950/extras/838b750592dcb78c9fd7a736f683f5cc.avif?t=1743104765\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
